 ## Background
-OTS (Opacity-Thin-Side) is a variant of EWA Splatting. It builds on [EWA Splatting](1069-ewa-splatting.md). The method was introduced in "Does 3D Gaussian Splatting Need Accurate Volumetric Rendering?" [S1].
